  "description": "EWAXEH02 crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P 3 1 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C6 H15 Dy1 O9,C12 H27 Dy1 O9 S3,2(C72 H120 Cr3 Dy6 N3 O57 S3),15(H2 O1),1.5(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Cr1 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Cr3 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy10 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Cr4 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Cr2 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy11 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy12 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Cr5 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy13 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy14 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Cr6 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 18 pairs, 8 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.339-4.133 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.70-113.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C6H15DyO9,C12H27DyO9S3,2(C72H120Cr3Dy6N3O57S3),15(H2O),1.5(C2H3N). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
